dq8in 1
# SLUS-21207 (the only region profile so far): boot to the title screen.
# Our own input, authored for DQ8-Native M3 (no game data).
# Every screen before the title runs in mode 4 with the TITLE overlay resident:
#   1. the memory-card check, which passes without input on an unformatted card;
#   2. the first-run settings: Down, Cross, Cross;
#   3. the logo movies: Cross skips each one;
#   4. the title.
# Offsets are first estimates. M3 bring-up tunes them against the run's events
# (Docs/milestones/M3-boots.md, "Bring-up log"). With --movies skip the player returns at once, and the
# Cross presses are harmless.

# The first-run settings screen comes after TITLE is resident and the memory-card check.
after overlay:TITLE +600 press down 4
+30 press cross 4
+30 press cross 4

# The logo movies.
+120 press cross 4
+120 press cross 4
+120 press cross 4
+120 press cross 4
